# Verifier Contract — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

**Spec ID:** {{SPEC_ID}}

This contract defines exactly when a build iteration is "done." RALPH runs every check at the end of every loop iteration. **All checks must pass — no exceptions, no overrides.**

---

## Machine-Readable Section

```yaml
# Parsed by RALPH. Do not change the structure — only edit values.
checks:
  - id: build_passes
    command: "{{BUILD_COMMAND}}"
    expect: "exit_code == 0"
    description: "Project compiles / type-checks without errors"

  - id: tests_pass
    command: "{{TEST_COMMAND}}"
    expect: "exit_code == 0"
    description: "All tests pass; no test.skip or xit"

  - id: lint_clean
    command: "{{LINT_COMMAND}}"
    expect: "exit_code == 0"
    description: "Linter reports zero errors and zero warnings"

  - id: acceptance_criteria
    source: "PRD.md § Acceptance Criteria"
    expect: "all numbered items verified"
    description: "Each PRD acceptance criterion has a corresponding test or observable check"

  # Add project-specific checks below this line.
  # - id: e2e_smoke
  #   command: "npm run test:e2e"
  #   expect: "exit_code == 0"
  #   description: "End-to-end smoke test against the deployed preview"
```

